From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 02:02:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add OrgKit Session Workbench as default home (1.8.0)

Replace the feature-grid landing page with a session desk: quick launch,
Continue activity for SOQL/Apex/describe/metadata, pinned per-org queries,
and a local scratch pad. History stays in chrome.storage.local with no sid.

Co-authored-by: rajeevketha <rajeevketha@users.noreply.github.com>
