+# OrgKit — downloadable packages
+
+## Current (1.8.0 — Session Workbench)
+
+- `OrgKit-1.8.0-unpacked.zip` — unzip → Chrome Load unpacked (local testing)
+- `OrgKit-1.8.0-store.zip` — same payload (manifest at zip root)
+- `OrgKit-CURRENT.zip` / `OrgKit-store.zip` — stable aliases
+
+### Test locally
+
+1. Download and unzip `OrgKit-1.8.0-unpacked.zip`
+2. Chrome → `chrome://extensions` → Developer mode
+3. **Load unpacked** → select the unzipped folder
+4. Open a logged-in Salesforce tab → Alt+Shift+O
